							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10318#msg10318"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10318#msg10318">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #41 on:</b> August 21, 2004, 03:19:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10315#msg10315">Quote from: Castamist on August 21, 2004, 02:52:30 pm</a></div><div class="quote">DramaPrz is a fucktard all right! This is the worst attempt of impersonation I&#039;ve ever seen. <br /><br />First:  I can imagine Daarksun is an extremely busy person with a guild to lead so that leaves them little time to &#039;chit-chat&#039; in a &#039;rant and rave&#039; forum. <br /><br />Second:... must quote here: <br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Daarksun<br />Guild Leader<br />65 Dark Elf Shadowknight<br /><br />First off - once again,</div><br />We&#039;re not in 1st grade and you should write your &#039;name&#039; at the top of your paper! That goes toward the bottom of the end of your text.<br /><br />Next: WT-double-F is this? <br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Last edited by Daarksun on Fri Aug 13, 2004 9:10 am; edited 1 time in total</div><br />Are you completely clueless to how an edit message is formatted?  It&#8217;s not that hard to find an example, and when you edit, the person who edits the post will have their name appear as the editor, not someone else! NOBODY else can edit your post (besides moderators) so how could Daarksun edit a message written by DramaPrz? Wonder how he could&#039;ve edited it on Fri Aug 13, 2004 9:10 am when the post was created on August 17, 2004, 01:31:50 pm. Really dude, your brain is a muscle and needs to be used or it&#039;ll turn to mush. <br /><br />Lastly, This post does not offend me.  I&#039;m just insulted and/or embarrassed by this sad attempt. So...  !!! DramaPrz WHAT TEH?  $%)(*#$  !!!! $(#$% DramaPrz !!! HATE DramaPrz @*$% DRAMA U IN TEH FACE!!!! DramaPrz $(*%$)DIE INTHE FACE)(*#$  !!!! $(#$% PRZ!<br /><br />Last edited by Grem on Fri Aug 41, 2004 9:10 am; edited 1 time in total<br /><br /><br /></div>And that ladies and gentlemen is how you rant.  It has all the required element, lots of special characters, uses the word fucktard, makes references to the person&#039;s grade level (or apparent grade level), etc.<br /><br />It brings a tear to my eye
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
